Spell Order and Effects
1st Spell: Glimmer
How to obtain: Picked up directly from the wooden sign at the forest entrance 
Spell effect: A soft glow of light appears in the palm of your hand
Game function: Illuminates dark areas, helps discover hidden items and clues

2nd Spell: Whisper
How to obtain: To be designed
Spell effect: Understand the speech of animals and plants
Game function: Talk to forest creatures, gain puzzle clues and story information

3rd Spell: Lightfoot
How to obtain: Complete the "Little Spirit's Key" quest chain 
Spell effect: Body becomes lighter, jump higher
Game function: Reach higher platforms, unlock new exploration areas; used for jumping on mushroom steps, climbing tall trees, etc.

4th Spell: Grow
How to obtain: To be designed
Spell effect: Make plants grow quickly
Game function: Grow vines, flowers, and trees; solve plant-related puzzles

5th Spell: Stardust
How to obtain: Moonlit Clearing, the final trial of Grandma Meryl
Spell effect: Creates a unique magic based on the player's journey experiences
Game function: The final spell; collect all 5 pages to complete the spellbook and finish the game
